hadiths[122]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1150","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke aik mard ne Abdullah bin Abbas se kaha ke maine apni biwi ko sau talaaqein din to tum mere liye kya kehte ho. To Ibn Abbas ne us se kaha ke tum se teen talaaqein huin aur sattanwe jin se tum ne Allah ki aayaton ko mazaq banaya."
"1151","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke aik mard Masud ke bete Abdullah bin Masud ke paas aaya aur kaha ke maine apni biwi ko aath talaaqein din. To Ibn Masud ne kaha ke tumhein kya kaha gaya. Unhon ne kaha ke mujhe kaha gaya ke wo mujh se juda ho gayi hai. To Masud ke bete Ibn Masud ne kaha ke unhon ne sach kaha, jo talaaq de jaisa Allah ne use hukm diya to Allah ne us ke liye wazeh kar diya, aur jo apne upar uljhan dale uljhan ko hum us se chipka denge, apne upar uljhan na dalo aur hum use tum se uthaein, wo waisa hai jaisa wo kehte hain."
"1152","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Abu Bakr se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne us se kaha ke albatta log is mein kya kehte hain. Abu Bakr ne kaha ke maine us se kaha ke Usman ke bete Aban use aik banate they. To Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne kaha ke agar talaaq hazaar hoti to albatta is mein se kuchh na bachati, jo albatta kahe us ne door ki had ko phenk diya."
"1153","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Hakam ke bete Marwan us ke bare mein faisla karte they jo apni biwi ko albatta talaaq de ke wo teen talaaqein hain. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi mujhe sab se pasand hai."
"1154","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Iraq se Umar bin Khattab ko likha gaya ke aik mard ne apni biwi se kaha ke tumhari rassi tumhari kohaan par hai, to Umar bin Khattab ne apne aamil ko likha ke use hukm do ke mausam mein Makka mein mere paas aae, phir jabke Umar Baitullah ka tawaf kar rahe they to wo mard un se mila aur unhein salam kya to Umar ne kaha ke tum kaun ho. To us ne kaha ke main hun jise hukm diya gaya ke aap ke paas laya jaun. To Umar ne us se kaha ke main tum se is imarat ke Rab ki qasam dekar puchhta hun ke tum ne apne qaul se kya irada kya ke tumhari rassi tumhari kohaan par hai. To mard ne us se kaha ke agar aap mujhe is jagah ke ilawa mein qasam dete to main aap se sach na kehta, maine is se judai ka irada kya tha. To Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke wo hai jo tum ne irada kya."
"1155","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Ali bin Abi Talib us mard ke bare mein kehte they jo apni biwi se kahe ke tum mujh par haram ho ke wo teen talaaqein hain. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai."
"1156","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar khaliya aur bariya ke bare mein kehte they ke wo teen teen talaaqein hain, in dono mein se har aik."
"1157","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim se riwayat kya ke aik mard ke nikah mein qoum ki londi thi to us ne us ke ghar walon se kaha ke is se tumhara kaam hai. To logon ne samjha ke ye aik talaaq hai."
"1158","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ko kehte suna ke us mard ke bare mein jo apni biwi se kahe ke main tum se bari hun aur tum mujh se bari ho ke wo teen talaaqein hain albatta ke manzilay mein. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo apni biwi se kahe ke tum khaliya ya bariya ya baina ho ke wo teen talaaqein hain us aurat ke liye jis se dakhil ho chuka ho, aur us ke liye jis se dakhil na hua ho us par qasam khilayi jaegi ke aik ka irada kya ya teen ka, phir agar kahe ke aik to us se is par qasam li jae gi aur wo mangni karne walon mein se mangni karne wala hoga kyunke wo aurat jise us ka shohar dakhil kar chuka ho use aik se khali nahi karta aur na use juda karta aur na use bari karta magar teen talaaqon se, aur wo jise dakhil na hua ho use aik se khali karta hai aur bari karta hai aur juda karta hai. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai."
"1159","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke aik mard Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aaya aur kaha ke aye Abu Abdur Rahman maine apni biwi ka muamla us ke haath mein kar diya to us ne apne aap ko talaaq de di to tum kya kehte ho. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke meri rai hai jaisa us ne kaha. To mard ne kaha ke aisa na karo aye Abu Abdur Rahman. To Ibn Umar ne kaha ke main karunga, tum ne kya."
"1160","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jab mard apni biwi ko us ka muamla malik kare to faisla wo hai jo wo faisla kare magar ke wo us par inkar kare aur kahe ke maine aik ke siwa irada na kya tha to is par qasam khae aur wo us ka zyada haqdar hoga jab tak wo us ki iddat mein ho."
"1161","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Sabit ke bete Zaid ke bete Sulaiman ke bete Saeed se, unhon ne Sabit ke bete Zaid ke bete Kharija se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke wo Sabit ke bete Zaid ke paas baithe they to un ke paas Atiq ke bete Abi Atiq ke bete Muhammad aae jabke un ki dono aankhein aansu baha rahi thin to Zaid ne us se kaha ke tumhara kya haal hai. To us ne kaha ke maine apni biwi ko us ka muamla malik kya to us ne mujh se judai kar li. To Zaid ne us se kaha ke tumhein is par kis ne ubhara. Unhon ne kaha ke taqdeer ne. To Zaid ne kaha ke is se ruju karo agar tum chaho kyunke ye to aik hai aur tum is ke zyada haqdar ho."
"1162","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Saqif mein se aik mard ne apni biwi ko us ka muamla malik kya to us ne kaha ke tum talaaq ho to wo khamosh raha, phir us ne kaha ke tum talaaq ho to us ne kaha ke tumhare munh mein pathar ho, phir us ne kaha ke tum talaaq ho to us ne kaha ke tumhare munh mein pathar ho. To un dono ne Hakam ke bete Marwan se jhagda kya to us ne use qasam di ke us ne use aik ke siwa malik na kya tha aur use us ki taraf lautaya. Malik ne kaha ke Abdur Rahman ne kaha ke Qasim ko ye faisla pasand tha aur use is bare mein jo suna sab se behtar samajhte they. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai aur mujhe zyada pasand hai."
"1163","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abu Bakr ke bete Abdur Rahman par Umayya ke bete Abi Umayya ki beti Quraiba ka paigham diya to unhon ne un se byah diya, phir unhon ne Abdur Rahman par aitraz kya aur kaha ke hum ne to Aaisha ke siwa nikah na kya tha, to Aaisha ne Abdur Rahman ki taraf bheja aur un se is ka zikr kya to unhon ne Quraiba ka muamla us ke haath mein kar diya to us ne apne shohar ko muntakhab kya aur ye talaaq na thi."
"1164","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Hafsa ka Zubair ke bete Munzir se nikah kya jabke Abdur Rahman Sham mein ghaib they, phir jab Abdur Rahman aae to kaha ke mere jaisa se ye kya jae aur mere jaisa par daka dala jae, to Aaisha ne Zubair ke bete Munzir se baat ki to Munzir ne kaha ke ye Abdur Rahman ke haath mein hai. To Abdur Rahman ne kaha ke main wo muamla radd na karunga jo tum ne faisla kya, to Hafsa Munzir ke paas qaim rahin aur ye talaaq na thi."
"1165","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar ke bete Abdullah bin Umar aur Abu Huraira se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jo apni biwi ko us ka muamla malik kare aur wo use us ki taraf lauta de aur is mein koi faisla na kare. To un dono ne kaha ke ye talaaq nahi."
"1166","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jab mard apni biwi ko us ka muamla malik kare aur wo is se juda na ho aur us ke paas qaim rahe to ye talaaq nahi. Malik ne us mumallaka ke bare mein kaha jise us ka shohar us ka muamla malik kare phir wo dono juda hon aur wo is mein se kuchh qubool na kare to us ke haath mein is mein se kuchh nahi aur ye us ke liye hai jab tak wo dono apni majlis mein hon."
"1167","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Jafar se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ali bin Abi Talib se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jab mard apni biwi se eela kare to us par talaaq wajeh nahi hoti agarche chaar mahine guzar jaein yahan tak ke use thehraya jae, phir ya to talaaq de ya ruju kare. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai."
"1168","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jo mard apni biwi se eela kare to jab chaar mahine guzar jaein to use thehraya jaega yahan tak ke talaaq de ya ruju kare, aur us par talaaq wajeh nahi hoti jab chaar mahine guzar jaein yahan tak ke use thehraya jae."
"1169","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Saeed bin Musayyab aur Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Bakr kehte they ke us mard ke bare mein jo apni biwi se eela kare ke jab chaar mahine guzar jaein to wo talaaq hai aur us ke shohar ke liye us par ruju hai jab tak wo iddat mein ho."
"1170","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Hakam ke bete Marwan us mard ke bare mein faisla karte they jab wo apni biwi se eela kare ke jab chaar mahine guzar jaein to wo talaaq hai aur us ke liye us par ruju hai jab tak wo apni iddat mein ho. Malik ne kaha ke Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ki rai bhi is par thi. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo apni biwi se eela kare aur chaar mahinon ke guzarne par thehraya jae aur talaaq de phir apni biwi se ruju kare ke agar use na pahunche yahan tak ke us ki iddat poori ho jae to us ke liye us tak koi rasta nahi aur us par us ke liye ruju nahi magar ke us ke paas bimari ya qaid ya is jaisa uzr ho, phir us ka is se ruju karna us par sabit hai, phir agar us ki iddat guzar jae phir is ke baad is se nikah kare to agar use na pahunche yahan tak ke chaar mahine guzar jaein to use bhi thehraya jaega, phir agar ruju na kare to us par pehle eela se talaaq dakhil hogi jab chaar mahine guzar jaein aur us ke liye us par ruju na hoga kyunke us ne is se nikah kya phir use is se pehle talaaq di ke use chhue to us par us ki iddat nahi aur na ruju. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo apni biwi se eela kare aur chaar mahinon ke baad thehraya jae aur talaaq de phir ruju kare aur use na chhue aur chaar mahine guzar jaein is se pehle ke us ki iddat poori ho ke use na thehraya jaega aur na us par talaaq wajeh hogi, aur agar use is se pehle pahunche ke us ki iddat poori ho to wo is ka zyada haqdar hoga, aur agar us ki iddat us se pehle poori ho jae ke use pahunche to us ke liye us tak koi rasta nahi, aur is bare mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo apni biwi se eela kare phir use talaaq de aur chaar mahine guzar jaein talaaq ki iddat poori hone se pehle. Unhon ne kaha ke wo do talaaqein hain agar wo thehraya jae aur ruju na kare, aur agar talaaq ki iddat chaar mahinon se pehle guzar jae to eela talaaq nahi, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke wo chaar mahine jin ke baad thehraya jata tha guzar gae jabke wo us din us ki biwi nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jo qasam khae ke apni biwi se din ya mahina sohbat na karega phir thehre yahan tak ke chaar mahinon se zyada guzar jae to ye eela na hoga, eela mein to use thehraya jaega jo chaar mahinon se zyada par qasam khae, aur jo qasam khae ke apni biwi se chaar mahine ya is se kam sohbat na karega to meri rai nahi ke us par eela hai kyunke jab wo muddat dakhil ho jis par thehraya jata hai to wo apni qasam se nikal gaya aur us par thehrana na hoga. Malik ne kaha ke jo apni biwi se qasam khae ke use na chhuega yahan tak ke us ka bacha doodh chhurae to ye eela na hoga."
"1171","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne aik se zyada se riwayat kya ke Masud ke bete Abdullah se Kufa mein jabke wo wahan they us maan ke nikah ke bare mein fatwa manga gaya beti ke baad ka jab beti ko chhua na gaya tha to is mein rukhsat di, phir Masud ke bete Ibn Masud Madina aae aur is ke bare mein pucha to unhein khabar di gayi ke ye waisa nahi jaisa unhon ne kaha, shart to rabaib mein hai, to Masud ke bete Ibn Masud Kufa ki taraf laute aur apne ghar tak na pahunche yahan tak ke us mard ke paas aae jise unhon ne is ka fatwa diya tha aur use hukm diya ke apni biwi se juda ho. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jis ke nikah mein aurat ho phir wo us ki maan se nikah kare aur use pahunche ke us par us ki biwi haram ho jati hai aur wo in dono se juda ho aur wo dono us par hamesha haram hain jab wo maan ko pahunch chuka ho, phir agar maan ko na pahunche to us par us ki biwi haram nahi aur maan se juda ho. Aur Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo aurat se nikah kare phir us ki maan se nikah kare aur use pahunche ke us ke liye us ki maan kabhi halal nahi aur na us ke baap ke liye aur na us ke bete ke liye, aur na us ke liye us ki beti halal hai aur us par us ki biwi haram hai. Malik ne kaha ke zina ka muamla ye hai ke wo is mein se koi cheez haram nahi karta kyunke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne farmaya ke tumhari auraton ki maaein, to haram to wo kya jo nikah ho, aur zina ki hurmat ka zikr na kya, to har nikah jo halal taur par ho aur us ka karne wala apni biwi ko pahunche wo halal nikah ke manzilay mein hai, ye jo maine suna aur jis par logon ka muamla hamare nazdeek hai."
"1172","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se ghulam ke eela ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha ke wo azaad ke eela jaisa hai, aur wo us par wajib hai aur ghulam ka eela do mahine hai."
"1173","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zurqi Saleem ke bete Amr ke bete Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim se us mard ke bare mein pucha jis ne aurat ko talaaq di agar wo is se nikah kare. To Muhammad ke bete Qasim ne kaha ke aik mard ne aurat ko apne upar apni maan ki peeth jaisa banaya agar wo is se nikah kare to Umar bin Khattab ne use hukm diya ke agar wo is se nikah kare to use na chhue yahan tak ke zihar karne wale ka kaffara de."
"1174","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke aik mard ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se us mard ke bare mein pucha jo apni biwi se is se pehle zihar kare ke is se nikah kare. To un dono ne kaha ke agar wo is se nikah kare to use na chhue yahan tak ke zihar karne wale ka kaffara de."
"1175","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo apni chaar biwiyon se aik kalime se zihar kare ke us par aik kaffare ke siwa kuchh nahi. Aur mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se is jaisa riwayat kya. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm is par hai, Allah Taala ne zihar karne wale ke kaffare mein farmaya ke gardan azad karna is se pehle ke dono chhuein. Phir jo na paye to lagatar do mahine roza is se pehle ke dono chhuein, phir jo taqat na rakhe to saath miskeenon ko khilana. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo apni biwi se alag alag majlison mein zihar kare. Unhon ne kaha ke us par aik kaffare ke siwa kuchh nahi, phir agar zihar kare phir kaffara de phir kaffara dene ke baad zihar kare to us par kaffara bhi hai. Malik ne kaha ke jo apni biwi se zihar kare phir use is se pehle chhue ke kaffara de us par aik kaffare ke siwa kuchh nahi aur wo is se ruke yahan tak ke kaffara de aur Allah se maghfirat mange, aur is bare mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai. Malik ne kaha ke doodh aur nasab wali mahramon se zihar barabar hai. Malik ne kaha ke auraton par zihar nahi. Malik ne Allah Tabarak wa Taala ke qaul ke bare mein kaha ke jo apni auraton se zihar karte hain phir jo kaha us ki taraf lautte hain. Unhon ne kaha ke maine suna hai ke is ki tafseer ye hai ke mard apni biwi se zihar kare phir use rokne aur pahunchne par jama ho, phir agar is par jama ho to us par kaffara wajib ho gaya, aur agar use talaaq de aur apne is se zihar ke baad use rokne aur pahunchne par jama na ho to us par kaffara nahi. Malik ne kaha ke phir agar is ke baad is se nikah kare to use na chhue yahan tak ke zihar karne wale ka kaffara de. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo apni londi se zihar kare ke agar wo use pahunchna chahe to us par zihar ka kaffara hai is se pehle ke use chhue. Malik ne kaha ke mard par us ke zihar mein eela dakhil nahi hota magar ke wo nuqsan dene wala ho jo apne zihar se ruju karne ka irada na rakhta ho."
"1176","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Asadiya Tulaiha Saqafi Rashid ke nikah mein thin to us ne use talaaq di to us ne apni iddat mein nikah kya to Umar bin Khattab ne use mara aur us ke shohar ko kore se chand martaba mara aur in dono ke darmiyan judai karai, phir Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo aurat apni iddat mein nikah kare to agar us ka shohar jis ne is se nikah kya ho is se dakhil na hua ho to in dono ke darmiyan judai karai jae phir wo apne pehle shohar se apni baqi iddat poori kare phir dusra mangni karne walon mein se mangni karne wala ho, aur agar wo is se dakhil ho chuka ho to in dono ke darmiyan judai karai jae phir wo pehle se apni baqi iddat poori kare phir dusre se iddat poori kare phir wo dono kabhi jama na hon. Unhon ne kaha."
"1177","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke unhon ne aik mard ko Zubair ke bete Urwa se us mard ke bare mein puchte suna jis ne apni biwi se kaha ke har aurat jis se main tum par nikah karun jab tak jeeun wo mujh par meri maan ki peeth jaisi hai. To Zubair ke bete Urwa ne kaha ke use is se gardan azad karna kafi hoga."
"1178","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se ghulam ke zihar ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha ke azaad ke zihar jaisa. Malik ne kaha ke un ka irada hai ke wo us par wajeh hota hai jaisa azaad par wajeh hota hai. Malik ne kaha ke ghulam ka zihar us par wajib hai aur zihar mein ghulam ka roza do mahine hai. Malik ne us ghulam ke bare mein kaha jo apni biwi se zihar kare ke us par eela dakhil nahi hota, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke agar wo zihar karne wale ke kaffare ka roza rakhne jae to is se pehle eela ki talaaq us par dakhil ho jaegi ke wo apne roze se farigh ho."
"1179","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Barira mein teen sunnatein thin, to teen sunnaton mein se aik ye thi ke wo azad ki gayi to apne shohar mein ikhtiyar di gayi, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wala us ke liye hai jo azad kare. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dakhil hue jabke deg gosht se josh maar rahi thi to Aap ke paas roti aur ghar ke salan mein se salan qareeb kya gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya maine deg na dekhi jis mein gosht hai. To unhon ne kaha ke kyun nahi ya Rasulullah lekin ye wo gosht hai jo Barira ko sadqa kya gaya tha aur aap sadqa nahi khate. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo us par sadqa hai aur hamare liye tohfa hai."
"1180","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke us londi ke bare mein jo ghulam ke nikah mein ho aur azad ho jae ke londi ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak use na chhue. Malik ne kaha ke agar us ka shohar use chhue aur wo kahe ke wo jahil thi ke us ke liye ikhtiyar hai to wo tohmat wali hogi aur apni jahalat ke dawe mein tasdeeq na ki jaegi aur use chhune ke baad us ke liye ikhtiyar nahi."
"1181","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se riwayat kya ke Adi ke Banu ki azad karda jise Zabra kaha jata hai ne unhein khabar di ke wo ghulam ke nikah mein thi jabke wo us din londi thi to azad hui. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Hafsa ki taraf bheja to unhon ne mujhe bulaya aur kaha ke main tumhein khabar dungi aur main pasand nahi karti ke tum koi cheez karo, tumhara muamla tumhare haath mein hai jab tak tumhara shohar tumhein na chhue, phir agar wo tumhein chhue to tumhare liye muamle mein se kuchh nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke wo talaaq hai phir talaaq phir talaaq. To maine is se teen se judai kar li."
"1182","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Saeed bin Musayyab se khabar pahunchi ke unhon ne kaha ke jo mard aisi aurat se nikah kare jis mein deewangi ya nuqsan ho to use ikhtiyar di jaegi, phir agar chahe qaim rahe aur agar chahe juda ho. Malik ne us londi ke bare mein kaha jo ghulam ke nikah mein ho phir is se pehle azad ho jae ke us se dakhil ho ya use chhue ke agar wo apne aap ko muntakhab kare to us ka meher nahi aur ye talaaq hai, aur hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai."
"1183","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna ke jab mard apni biwi ko ikhtiyar de aur wo use muntakhab kare to ye talaaq nahi. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai. Malik ne us mukhayyara ke bare mein kaha jise us ka shohar ikhtiyar de aur wo apne aap ko muntakhab kare to wo teen talaaq de di gayi, aur agar us ka shohar kahe ke maine tumhein aik ke siwa ikhtiyar na diya tha to us ke liye ye nahi. Aur is bare mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai. Malik ne kaha ke agar use ikhtiyar de aur wo kahe ke maine aik qubool ki aur wo kahe ke maine ye irada na kya tha, maine to tumhein teenon mein ikhtiyar diya tha, ke agar wo aik ke siwa qubool na kare to wo us ke paas apne nikah par qaim rahe aur ye judai na hogi insha Allah Taala."
"1184","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein Ansari Sahl ki beti Habiba se khabar di ke wo Qais ke bete Sabit ke bete Sabit ke nikah mein thin aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah ki taraf nikle to andhere mein Sahl ki beti Habiba ko apne darwaze par paya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke ye kaun hai. To us ne kaha ke main Sahl ki beti Habiba hun ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke tumhara kya haal hai. Us ne kaha ke na main aur na Qais ke bete Sabit, apne shohar ke liye. Phir jab us ka shohar Qais ke bete Sabit aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke ye Sahl ki beti Habiba hai jo Allah ne chaha ke kahe keh chuki hai. To Habiba ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah jo us ne mujhe diya sab mere paas hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Qais ke bete Sabit se farmaya ke is se le lo. To us ne is se le liya aur wo apne ghar walon ke ghar baith gayin."
"1185","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Ubaid ke bete Abi Ubaid ki beti Safiya ki azad karda se riwayat kya ke us ne apne shohar se apne tamam maal se khula kya to Abdullah bin Umar ne is ka inkar na kya. Malik ne us muftadiya ke bare mein kaha jo apne shohar se fidya de ke jab maloom ho ke us ka shohar use nuqsan pahunchata hai aur us par tangi karta hai aur maloom ho ke wo us par zulm karne wala hai to talaaq nafiz hogi aur us ka maal us ki taraf lautaya jaega. Unhon ne kaha ke jo main sunta tha yehi hai aur jis par logon ka muamla hamare nazdeek hai. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke aurat apne shohar se is se zyada se fidya de jo us ne use diya tha."
"1186","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Afra ke bete Muaz ki beti Rabi apne chacha ke sath Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aayi aur unhein khabar di ke us ne apne shohar se Affan ke bete Usman ke zamane mein khula kya to ye Affan ke bete Usman tak pahuncha aur unhon ne is ka inkar na kya. Aur Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke us ki iddat mutallaqa ki iddat hai."
"1187","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman aur Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab kehte they ke mukhtalia ki iddat mutallaqa ki iddat jaisi hai, teen quru. Malik ne us muftadiya ke bare mein kaha ke wo apne shohar ki taraf na laute magar nae nikah se, phir agar wo is se nikah kare aur use is se pehle juda kare ke use chhue to us ke liye us par aakhri talaaq se iddat nahi aur wo apni pehli iddat par bina kare. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai. Malik ne kaha ke jab aurat apne shohar se kisi cheez se fidya de is par ke wo use talaaq de aur wo use lagatar pai dar pai talaaq de to ye us par sabit hai, phir agar is ke darmiyan khamoshi ho to jo khamoshi ke baad is ke peechhe aae wo kuchh nahi."
"1188","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Saadi Sahl bin Saad ne unhein khabar di ke Ajlani Uwaimir Adi Ansari ke bete Asim ke paas aaya aur us se kaha ke aye Asim kya tum ne dekha ke mard apni biwi ke sath mard pae to kya use qatal kare aur tum use qatal karo ya wo kaise kare, aye Asim mere liye is ke bare mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se pucho. To Asim ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is ke bare mein pucha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sawalon ko makrooh samjha aur unhein aibdar samjha yahan tak ke Asim par jo us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna bada hua, phir jab Asim apne ghar walon ki taraf lauta to us ke paas Uwaimir aaya aur kaha ke aye Asim Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tum se kya kaha. To Asim ne Uwaimir se kaha ke tum mere paas bhalai lekar na aae, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us sawal ko makrooh samjha jo maine Aap se pucha tha. To Uwaimir ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam main na rukunga yahan tak ke is ke bare mein puchhun. To Uwaimir aaya yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah kya aap ne dekha ke mard apni biwi ke sath mard pae to kya use qatal kare aur tum use qatal karo ya wo kaise kare. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhare aur tumhari sahiba ke bare mein nazil ho chuka hai to jao aur use lekar aao. Sahl ne kaha ke un dono ne lian kya jabke main logon ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas tha, phir jab wo dono apne lian se farigh hue to Uwaimir ne kaha ke maine is par ya Rasulullah jhoot bola hai agar main use rokun. To us ne use teen talaaqein din is se pehle ke Rasulullah use hukm dein. Aur Malik ne kaha ke Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke ye is ke baad lian karne walon ki sunnat thin."
"1189","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke aik mard ne apni biwi se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein lian kya aur us ke bache se alag hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne in dono ke darmiyan judai karai aur bache ko aurat se milaya."
"1190","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Zubair ke bete Urwa mulaana ke bache aur zina ke bache ke bare mein kehte they ke jab wo mare to us ki maan us ke haq ki waris hogi Allah Taala ki kitab mein aur us ke maan shareek bhai apne huqooq ke aur baqi mawali waris honge us ki maan ke agar wo azad karda ho, aur agar wo Arabi ho to wo apne haq ki waris hogi aur us ke maan shareek bhai apne huqooq ke waris honge aur jo baqi ho musalmanon ke liye hoga. Malik ne kaha ke mujhe Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se is jaisa khabar pahunchi. Aur is par maine apne shehar ke ahl-e-ilm ko paya."
"1191","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhein Muhammad ke bete Qasim se khabar pahunchi ke wo dono kehte they ke jab azaad londi se nikah kare aur use chhue to us ne use muhsin kar diya. Malik ne kaha ke har wo jise maine paya kehta tha ke londi azaad ko muhsina karti hai jab wo is se nikah kare aur use chhue to us ne use muhsin kar diya. Malik ne kaha ke ghulam azaad aurat ko muhsin karta hai jab use nikah se chhue, aur azaad aurat ghulam ko muhsina nahi karti magar ke wo azad ho jabke wo us ka shohar ho aur use azadi ke baad chhue, phir agar use is se pehle juda kare ke azad ho to wo muhsin nahi yahan tak ke azadi ke baad nikah kare aur apni biwi ko chhue. Malik ne kaha ke londi jab azaad ke nikah mein ho phir wo use is se pehle juda kare ke azad ho to us ka is se nikah use muhsin nahi karta jabke wo londi hai yahan tak ke azadi ke baad nikah kare aur us ka shohar use pahunche, to ye us ka ihsan hai, aur londi jab azaad ke nikah mein ho aur wo us ke paas hote hue azad ho jae is se pehle ke use juda kare to wo use muhsin karta hai jab wo us ke paas hote hue azad ho jae agar wo use azad hone ke baad pahunche. Aur Malik ne kaha ke azaad Nasrani aur Yahudi aur musalman londi azaad musalman ko muhsina karti hain jab wo in mein se kisi se nikah kare aur use pahunche."
"1192","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Thauban ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Muhammad se, unhon ne Bakir ke bete Iyas ke bete Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke aik mard ne apni biwi ko is se pehle teen talaaqein din ke us se dakhil ho, phir us ke liye zahir hua ke is se nikah kare to wo fatwa puchhne aaya to main us ke liye puchhne us ke sath gaya, to us ne Abdullah bin Abbas aur Abu Huraira se is ke bare mein pucha to un dono ne kaha ke hum nahi samajhte ke tum is se nikah karo yahan tak ke wo tumhare ilawa shohar se nikah kare. Unhon ne kaha ke meri is ko talaaq to aik hai. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke tum ne apne haath se bhej diya jo tumhare liye fazl mein se tha."
"1193","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Ashaj ke bete Abdullah ke bete Bakir se, unhon ne Ayyash Ansari ke bete Numan se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke aik mard Aas ke bete Amr ke bete Abdullah se us mard ke bare mein puchhne aaya jis ne apni biwi ko is se pehle teen talaaqein din ke use chhue. Ata ne kaha ke maine kaha ke kunwari ki talaaq to aik hai. To Aas ke bete Amr ke bete Abdullah ne mujh se kaha ke tum to qissa go ho, aik use juda karti hai aur teen use haram karti hain yahan tak ke wo tumhare ilawa shohar se nikah kare."
"1194","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Ashaj ke bete Abdullah ke bete Bakir se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein Ayyash Ansari ke bete Muawiya se khabar di ke wo Zubair ke bete Abdullah aur Khattab ke bete Umar ke bete Asim ke paas baithe they. Unhon ne kaha ke un dono ke paas Bakir ke bete Iyas ke bete Muhammad aae aur kaha ke dehat walon mein se aik mard ne apni biwi ko is se pehle teen talaaqein din ke us se dakhil ho to tum dono kya kehte ho. To Zubair ke bete Abdullah ne kaha ke is muamle mein hamare paas qaul nahi, to Abdullah bin Abbas aur Abu Huraira ke paas jao kyunke maine in dono ko Aaisha ke paas chhora hai, to in dono se pucho phir hamare paas aao aur hamein khabar do. To wo gaya aur in dono se pucha to Ibn Abbas ne Abu Huraira se kaha ke use fatwa do aye Abu Huraira kyunke tumhare paas mushkil aayi hai. To Abu Huraira ne kaha ke aik use juda karti hai aur teen use haram karti hain yahan tak ke wo tumhare ilawa shohar se nikah kare. Aur Ibn Abbas ne is jaisa kaha. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm is par hai, aur saeeba jab use mard malik ho aur wo is se dakhil na hua ho wo kunwari ke manzilay mein hai, aik use juda karti hai aur teen use haram karti hain yahan tak ke wo tumhare ilawa shohar se nikah kare."
"1195","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdullah ke bete Talha se, aur wo is mein sab se zyada janne wale they, aur Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma se riwayat kya ke Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ne apni biwi ko albatta talaaq di jabke wo beemar they to Affan ke bete Usman ne use is se is ki iddat guzarne ke baad wirasat dilayi."
"1196","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Fadl ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Araj se riwayat kya ke Affan ke bete Usman ne Mukammal ke bete Ibn Mukammal ki biwiyon ko is se wirasat dilayi jabke us ne inhein talaaq di thi jab wo beemar tha."
"1197","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia ko kehte suna ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ki biwi ne us se manga ke use talaaq de. To us ne kaha ke jab haiz aae phir pak ho to mujhe khabar do. To use haiz na aaya yahan tak ke Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman beemar hue, phir jab wo pak huin to us ne use khabar di to us ne use albatta talaaq de di ya aik talaaq jo us ke paas us par talaaq mein se baqi na rahi thi jabke Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman us din beemar they, to Affan ke bete Usman ne use is se is ki iddat guzarne ke baad wirasat dilayi."
"1198","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Habban ke bete Muhammad bin Yahya se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mere dada Habban ke paas do biwiyan thin Hashmi aur Ansari, to Ansari ko talaaq de di jabke wo doodh pila rahi thi, phir us par saal guzar gaya phir wo is se halaak hua jabke us ne haiz na kya tha, to us ne kaha ke main us ki waris hun, maine haiz na kya, to un dono ne Affan ke bete Usman se jhagda kya to us ne us ke liye wirasat ka faisla kya, to Hashmiya ne Usman ko malamat ki to us ne kaha ke ye tumhare chacha zad ka amal hai, us ne hamein is ka mashwara diya hai, yani Ali bin Abi Talib."
"1199","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ko kehte suna ke jab mard apni biwi ko teen talaaqein de jabke wo beemar ho to wo us ki waris hogi. Malik ne kaha ke agar wo use talaaq de jabke wo beemar ho is se pehle ke us se dakhil ho to us ke liye nisf meher hai aur us ke liye wirasat hai aur us par iddat nahi, aur agar us se dakhil ho phir use talaaq de to us ke liye mukammal meher hai aur wirasat hai, kunwari aur saeeba is mein hamare nazdeek barabar hain."
"1200","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ne apni aik biwi ko talaaq di aur londi se muta diya."
"1201","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke har mutallaqa ke liye muta hai siwae us ke jise talaaq di jae jabke us ke liye meher muqarrar ho chuka ho aur use chhua na gaya ho to us ke liye jo us ke liye muqarrar kya gaya us ka nisf kafi hai."
"1202","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke har mutallaqa ke liye muta hai. Malik ne kaha ke mujhe Muhammad ke bete Qasim se is jaisa khabar pahunchi. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek muta ki us ke thode aur zyada mein koi maroof had nahi."
"1203","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi aurat se nikah kare ya londi khareede to us ki peshani pakde aur barkat ki dua kare, aur jab oont khareede to us ke kohan ki choti pakde aur Allah se shaitan se panah mange."
"1204","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Nafi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ka mukatab ya us ka ghulam tha, us ke nikah mein azaad aurat thi to us ne use do talaaqein din phir wo is se ruju karna chahta tha to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyon ne use hukm diya ke Affan ke bete Usman ke paas aae aur is ke bare mein us se puchhe, to wo un se seedhi ke paas mila jabke wo Sabit ke bete Zaid ka haath pakde hue they to us ne in dono se pucha to un dono ne jaldi ki aur dono ne kaha ke tum par haram ho gayi, tum par haram ho gayi."
"1205","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Nafi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ka mukatab tha, us ne azaad aurat ko do talaaqein din to us ne Affan ke bete Usman se fatwa manga to unhon ne kaha ke tum par haram ho gayi."
"1206","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saeed ke bete Abd Rabbihi se, unhon ne Haris Taimi ke bete Muhammad bin Ibrahim se riwayat kya ke Nafi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ka mukatab tha, us ne Sabit ke bete Zaid se fatwa manga aur kaha ke maine azaad aurat ko do talaaqein din. To Sabit ke bete Zaid ne kaha ke tum par haram ho gayi."
"1207","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jab ghulam apni biwi ko do talaaqein de to wo us par haram ho gayi yahan tak ke wo is ke ilawa shohar se nikah kare, chahe azaad ho ya londi, aur azaad ki iddat teen haiz hai aur londi ki iddat do haiz hai."
"1208","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jo apne ghulam ko nikah ki ijazat de to talaaq ghulam ke haath mein hai, us ki talaaq mein se ghair ke haath mein kuchh nahi, aur jo mard apne ghulam ki londi ya apni waleeda ki londi le to us par koi gunah nahi."
"1209","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo aurat apne shohar ko gum kare aur na jane ke wo kahan hai to wo chaar saal intezar kare phir chaar mahine aur das din iddat guzare phir halal ho. Malik ne kaha ke agar wo apni iddat guzarne ke baad nikah kare aur us ka shohar is se dakhil ho ya is se dakhil na ho to us ke pehle shohar ke liye us tak koi rasta nahi. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai, aur agar us ka shohar use is se pehle pa le ke wo nikah kare to wo is ka zyada haqdar hai. Malik ne kaha ke maine logon ko paya ke wo is ka inkar karte hain jo baaz logon ne Umar bin Khattab par kaha ke unhon ne kaha ke us ka pehla shohar ikhtiyar diya jaega jab wo aae us ke meher mein ya us ki biwi mein."
"1210","Malik ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab ne us aurat ke bare mein kaha jise us ka shohar talaaq de jabke wo is se ghaib ho phir is se ruju kare aur use us ka ruju na pahunche jabke use us ka use talaaq dena pahunch chuka ho aur wo nikah kare ke agar us ka dusra shohar is se dakhil ho ya is se dakhil na ho to us ke pehle shohar ke liye jo use talaaq de chuka tha us tak koi rasta nahi. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi mujhe is mein aur mafqud mein sab se pasand hai."
"1211","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne apni biwi ko talaaq di jabke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein haiza thin to Umar bin Khattab ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is ke bare mein pucha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use hukm do ke is se ruju kare phir use roke yahan tak ke pak ho phir haiz aae phir pak ho, phir agar chahe is ke baad roke aur agar chahe is se pehle talaaq de ke chhue, to ye wo iddat hai jis ka Allah ne hukm diya hai ke auraton ko is ke liye talaaq di jae."
"1212","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Zubair ke bete Urwa se, unhon ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Siddiq ke bete Abu Bakr ke bete Abdur Rahman ki beti Hafsa muntaqil huin jab teesre haiz ke khoon mein dakhil huin. Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke is ka zikr Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se kya gaya to unhon ne kaha ke Urwa ne sach kaha, aur logon ne is mein un se jhagda kya aur kaha ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala apni kitab mein kehte hain ke teen quru. To Aaisha ne kaha ke tum ne sach kaha, kya tum jante ho ke aqra kya hain, aqra to tuhur hain."
"1213","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Bakr ko kehte suna ke maine apne fuqaha mein se kisi ko na paya magar wo ye kehta tha, yani Aaisha ka qaul."
"1214","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi aur Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Ahwas Sham mein halaak hua jab us ki biwi teesre haiz ke khoon mein dakhil hui thi jabke us ne use talaaq di thi, to Sufyan ke bete Muawiya ne Sabit ke bete Zaid ko likha aur is ke bare mein us se pucha to Zaid ne us ki taraf likha ke jab wo teesre haiz ke khoon mein dakhil ho to wo is se bari ho gayi aur wo is se bari ho gaya, aur na wo us ki waris hogi aur na wo us ka waris hoga."
"1215","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Muhammad ke bete Qasim aur Abdullah ke bete Salim aur Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Bakr aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman aur Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se khabar pahunchi ke wo kehte they ke jab mutallaqa teesre haiz ke khoon mein dakhil ho to wo apne shohar se juda ho gayi aur in dono ke darmiyan wirasat nahi aur na us par us ke liye ruju hai."
"1216","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jab mard apni biwi ko talaaq de aur wo teesre haiz ke khoon mein dakhil ho to wo is se bari ho gayi aur wo is se bari ho gaya. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai."
"1217","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah ke bete Abi Abdullah ke bete Fudail se riwayat kya ke Muhammad ke bete Qasim aur Abdullah ke bete Salim kehte they ke jab aurat ko talaaq di jae aur wo teesre haiz ke khoon mein dakhil ho to wo is se juda ho gayi aur halal ho gayi."
"1218","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Saeed bin Musayyab aur Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se khabar pahunchi ke wo kehte they ke mukhtalia ki iddat teen quru hai."
"1219","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ko kehte suna ke mutallaqa ki iddat aqra hai agarche door hon."
"1220","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Ansar mein se aik mard se riwayat kya ke us ki biwi ne us se talaaq mangi to us ne us se kaha ke jab haiz aae to mujhe khabar do. Phir jab use haiz aayi to us ne use khabar di to us ne kaha ke jab pak ho to mujhe khabar do, phir jab."
"1221","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne un dono ko zikr karte suna ke Aas ke bete Saeed ke bete Yahya ne Hakam ke bete Abdur Rahman ki beti ko albatta talaaq de di to Hakam ke bete Abdur Rahman ne use muntaqil kya to Momineen ki maan Aaisha ne Hakam ke bete Marwan ki taraf bheja jabke wo us din Madina ke ameer they aur kaha ke Allah se daro aur aurat ko us ke ghar ki taraf lautao. To Marwan ne Sulaiman ki hadis mein kaha ke Abdur Rahman mujh par ghalib aaya, aur Marwan ne Qasim ki hadis mein kaha ke kya tumhein Qais ki beti Fatima ka muamla na pahuncha. To Aaisha ne kaha ke tumhein nuqsan na dega ke Fatima ki hadis ka zikr na karo. To Marwan ne kaha ke agar tum mein shar ho to tumhare liye kafi hai jo in dono ke darmiyan shar se hai."
"1222","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Nufail ke bete Amr ke bete Zaid ke bete Saeed ki beti Affan ke bete Usman ke bete Amr ke bete Abdullah ke nikah mein thin to us ne use albatta talaaq de di to wo muntaqil huin to Abdullah bin Umar ne us par inkar kya."
"1223","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne apni aik biwi ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Hafsa ke rehne mein talaaq di jabke un ka masjid ki taraf rasta tha to wo gharon ke peechhe se dusra rasta chalte is napasand se ke us par ijazat mangein yahan tak ke is se ruju kya."
"1224","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Saeed bin Musayyab se us aurat ke bare mein pucha gaya jise us ka shohar talaaq de jabke wo kiraye ke ghar mein ho ke kiraya kis par hai. To Saeed bin Musayyab ne kaha ke us ke shohar par. Unhon ne kaha ke phir agar us ke shohar ke paas na ho. Unhon ne kaha ke us par. Unhon ne kaha ke phir agar us ke paas na ho. Unhon ne kaha ke ameer par."
"1225","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yazeed ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma se, unhon ne Qais ki beti Fatima se riwayat kya ke Hafs ke bete Abu Amr ne use albatta talaaq di jabke wo Sham mein ghaib they to us ki taraf apne wakeel se jau bheje to us ne use napasand kya to us ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam tumhare liye hum par kuchh nahi. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap se is ka zikr kya to Aap ne farmaya ke tumhare liye us par nafaqa nahi. Aur use hukm diya ke Umm Sharik ke ghar mein iddat guzare phir farmaya ke wo aisi aurat hai jise mere sahaba aate hain, Maktum ki maan ke bete Abdullah ke paas iddat guzaro kyunke wo andha mard hai tum us ke paas apne kapde utarti ho, phir jab halal ho to mujhe khabar do. Unhon ne kaha ke phir jab main halal hui to Aap se zikr kya ke Sufyan ke bete Muawiya aur Hisham ke bete Abu Jahm ne mujhe paigham diya hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abu Jahm to apni laathi apne kandhe se na utarta hai aur Muawiya nalaiq hai jis ka maal nahi, Zaid ke bete Usama se nikah karo. Unhon ne kaha ke maine use napasand kya phir Aap ne farmaya ke Zaid ke bete Usama se nikah karo. To us ne is se nikah kya to Allah ne is mein bhalai ki aur wo is se khush hui."
"1226","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab ko kehte suna ke mabtuta apne ghar se na nikle yahan tak ke halal ho, aur us ke liye nafaqa nahi magar ke wo haamila ho to us par kharch kare yahan tak ke apna hamal waza kare. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai."
"1227","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se aur Qusait Laithi ke bete Abdullah ke bete Yazeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo aurat talaaq di jae aur aik ya do haiz haiz aae phir us ka haiz use rok de to wo nau mahine intezar kare, phir agar us mein hamal zahir ho to yehi hai warna nau mahinon ke baad teen mahine iddat guzare phir halal ho."
"1228","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Saeed bin Musayyab kehte they ke talaaq mardon ke liye hai aur iddat auraton ke liye."
"1229","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mustahaza ki iddat saal hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek us mutallaqa ke bare mein hukm hai jise us ka haiz rok de jab us ka shohar use talaaq de ke wo nau mahine intezar kare, phir agar un mein haiz na aae to teen mahine iddat guzare, phir agar teen mahine mukammal hone se pehle haiz aae to haiz naye sire se shuru kare, phir agar us par haiz aane se pehle nau mahine guzar jaein to teen mahine iddat guzare, phir agar dusra haiz teen mahine mukammal hone se pehle aae to haiz naye sire se shuru kare, phir agar us par haiz aane se pehle nau mahine guzar jaein to teen mahine iddat guzare, phir agar teesra haiz aae to haiz ki iddat mukammal kar chuki, phir agar haiz na aae to teen mahine naye sire se shuru kare phir halal ho, aur us ke shohar ke liye is mein us par halal hone se pehle ruju hai magar ke us ne us ki talaaq ko qatai kar diya ho. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek sunnat hai ke mard jab apni biwi ko talaaq de jabke us ke liye us par ruju ho aur wo apni iddat ka baaz guzare phir is se ruju kare phir use is se pehle juda kare ke use chhue ke wo jo us ki iddat guzar chuki us par bina na kare aur wo jis din use talaaq de us din se aane wali iddat naye sire se shuru kare, aur us ke shohar ne apne upar zulm kya aur ghalti ki agar wo is se ruju kare jabke use is ki haajat na ho. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm hai ke aurat jab Islam le aae jabke us ka shohar kafir ho phir wo Islam le aae to wo is ka zyada haqdar hai jab tak wo us ki iddat mein ho, phir agar us ki iddat guzar jae to us ke liye us par koi rasta nahi, aur agar us ki iddat guzarne ke baad is se nikah kare to ye talaaq ko na lautaega, us se to Islam ne baghair talaaq ke faskh kya."
"1230","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Ali bin Abi Talib ne un do faisla karne walon ke bare mein kaha jin ke bare mein Allah Taala ne farmaya ke agar tumhein in dono ke darmiyan jhagde ka khauf ho to us ke ghar walon se aik faisla karne wala aur us ke ghar walon se aik faisla karne wala bhejo, agar wo dono islah chahenge to Allah in dono ke darmiyan muwafiqat karega, beshak Allah janne wala khabar rakhne wala hai, ke in dono ke paas in dono ke darmiyan judai aur jama hai. Malik ne kaha ke ahl-e-ilm se jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai ke do faisla karne walon ka qaul mard aur us ki biwi ke darmiyan judai aur jama mein jaiz hai."
"1231","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab aur Abdullah bin Umar aur Abdullah bin Masud aur Abdullah ke bete Salim aur Muhammad ke bete Qasim aur Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman kehte they ke jab mard aurat ki talaaq ki qasam khae is se pehle ke is se nikah kare phir gunah kare to ye us par lazim hai jab wo is se nikah kare."
"1232","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Masud ke bete Abdullah bin Masud kehte they ke jo kahe ke har aurat jis se main nikah karun wo talaaq hai ke jab wo qabeela ya muayyan aurat ka naam na le to us par kuchh nahi. Malik ne kaha ke jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai. Malik ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo apni biwi se kahe ke tum talaaq ho aur har aurat jis se main nikah karun wo talaaq hai aur mera maal sadqa hai agar main aisa aisa na karun aur wo qasam tore. Unhon ne kaha ke us ki biwiyan to talaaq hain jaisa us ne kaha, aur us ka qaul ke har aurat jis se main nikah karun wo talaaq hai, to jab wo muayyan aurat ya qabeela ya zameen ya is jaisa ka naam na le to ye us par lazim nahi aur wo nikah kare jo chahe, aur us ka maal to us ka tihai sadqa kare."
"1233","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jo aurat se nikah kare aur use chhu na sake to us ke liye saal ki muddat muqarrar ki jae gi, phir agar use chhue warna in dono ke darmiyan judai karai jae gi."
"1234","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se pucha ke muddat kab muqarrar ki jae gi, kya jis din is se ghar basae ya jis din hukmran ki taraf jhagda lekar jae. To unhon ne kaha ke balke jis din hukmran ki taraf jhagda lekar jae. Malik ne kaha ke jo apni biwi ko chhu chuka ho phir is se aajiz ho to maine na suna ke us ke liye muddat muqarrar ki jae aur na in dono ke darmiyan judai karai jae."
"1235","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Saqif mein se aik mard se farmaya jo Islam laya jabke us ke paas das biwiyan thin jab Saqafi Islam laya ke in mein se chaar roko aur baqiyon se juda ho."
"1236","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Saeed bin Musayyab aur Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Humaid aur Masud ke bete Utba ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman sab ko kehte suna ke maine Abu Huraira ko kehte suna ke maine Umar bin Khattab ko kehte suna ke jo aurat jise us ka shohar aik ya do talaaqein de phir use chhor de yahan tak ke halal ho aur is ke ilawa shohar se nikah kare aur wo is se mar jae ya use talaaq de phir us ka pehla shohar is se nikah kare to wo us ke paas us ki talaaq ke baqi par hogi. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek sunnat is par hai jis mein koi ikhtilaf nahi."
"1237","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ahnaf ke bete Sabit se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Khattab ke bete Zaid ke bete Abdur Rahman ki Umm Walad se nikah kya. Unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Khattab ke bete Zaid ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abdullah ne bulaya to main us ke paas aaya aur us ke paas dakhil hua to kode rakhe hue they aur lohe ki do bediyan aur us ke do ghulam jinhein us ne bithaya tha, to us ne kaha ke use talaaq de warna us zaat ki qasam jis se qasam khai jati hai main tumhare sath aisa aisa karunga. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke wo hazaar talaaq hai. Unhon ne kaha ke main us ke paas se nikla aur Makka ke raaste Abdullah bin Umar ko paya aur unhein apne muamle ki khabar di jo tha to Abdullah gusse hue aur kaha ke ye talaaq nahi aur wo tum par haram na hui, apne ghar walon ki taraf lauto. Unhon ne kaha ke mera nafs mujhe qaraar na de saka yahan tak ke Zubair ke bete Abdullah ke paas aaya jabke wo us din Makka mein us par ameer they, to unhein apne muamle ki khabar di jo tha aur jo Abdullah bin Umar ne mujh se kaha tha. Unhon ne kaha ke Zubair ke bete Abdullah ne mujh se kaha ke tum par haram na hui, apne ghar walon ki taraf lauto. Aur Zuhri Aswad ke bete Jabir ko likha jabke wo Madina ke ameer they, use hukm dete hue ke Abdur Rahman ke bete Abdullah ko saza de aur mere aur mere ghar walon ke darmiyan chhor de. Unhon ne kaha ke main Madina aaya to Umar ke bete Abdullah ki biwi Safiya ne meri biwi ko taiyar kya yahan tak ke use Abdullah bin Umar ke ilm se dakhil kya phir maine apne urs ke din apne waleeme ke liye Abdullah bin Umar ko bulaya to wo mere paas aae."
"1238","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Umar ko padhte suna ke aye Nabi jab tum auraton ko talaaq do to inhein in ki iddat se pehle talaaq do. Malik ne kaha ke un ka irada hai ke har tuhur mein aik martaba talaaq de."
"1239","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mard jab apni biwi ko talaaq deta phir is se ruju karta is se pehle ke us ki iddat guzar jae to ye us ke liye tha agarche use hazaar martaba talaaq de, to aik mard ne apni biwi ka irada kya aur use talaaq di yahan tak ke jab us ki iddat guzarne ke qareeb hui to is se ruju kya phir use talaaq di phir kaha ke Allah ki qasam main na tumhein panah dunga aur na tum kabhi halal hogi. To Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne nazil kya ke talaaq do martaba hai phir maroof se rokna ya ehsan se chhorna, to logon ne us din se talaaq naye sire se shuru ki jo un mein se talaaq de chuka tha ya na de chuka tha."
"1240","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Daili Zaid ke bete Saur se riwayat kya ke mard apni biwi ko talaaq deta phir is se ruju karta jabke use is ki haajat na hoti aur na use rokna chahta taake is se us par iddat lambi kare taake use nuqsan pahunchaye, to Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne nazil kya ke inhein nuqsan pahunchane ke liye zyadati karne ko na roko aur jo aisa kare us ne apne upar zulm kya, Allah unhein is se nasihat karta hai."
"1241","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se nashe wale ki talaaq ke bare mein pucha gaya to un dono ne kaha ke jab nashe wala talaaq de to us ki talaaq jaiz hai aur agar qatal kare to is se qatal kya jaega. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm is par hai."
"1242","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab kehte they ke jab mard wo na paye jo apni biwi par kharch kare to in dono ke darmiyan judai karai jae. Malik ne kaha ke is par maine apne shehar ke ahl-e-ilm ko paya."
"1243","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Qais ke bete Saeed ke bete Abd Rabbihi se, unhon ne Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abbas ke bete Abdullah bin Abbas aur Abu Huraira se us haamila aurat ke bare mein pucha gaya jis ka shohar mar jae. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke dono muddaton mein se aakhri. Aur Abu Huraira ne kaha ke jab bacha jane to halal ho gayi. To Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ke paas dakhil hue aur un se is ke bare mein pucha to Umm Salma ne kaha ke Aslami Sabia ne apne shohar ki wafat ke baad nisf mahine se bacha jana to use do mardon ne paigham diya, un mein se aik jawan aur dusra budha, to wo jawan ki taraf jhukin to budhe ne kaha ke abhi halal na hui. Aur us ke ghar wale ghaib they aur us ne umeed ki ke jab us ke ghar wale aaein to use is se tarjeeh dein, to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aayi to Aap ne farmaya ke halal ho gayin, jis se chaho nikah karo."
"1244","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke un se us aurat ke bare mein pucha gaya jis ka shohar mar jae jabke wo haamila ho. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke jab apna hamal waza kare to halal ho gayi. To un ke paas Ansar mein se aik mard ne unhein khabar di jo un ke paas tha ke Khattab ke bete Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke agar wo bacha jane jabke us ka shohar us ke bistar par ho aur abhi dafan na hua ho to halal ho gayi."
"1245","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Makhrama ke bete Miswar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Aslami Sabia ne apne shohar ki wafat ke baad raaton se nafas paya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke halal ho gayin, jis se chaho nikah karo."
"1246","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se riwayat kya ke Abbas ke bete Abdullah bin Abbas aur Auf ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Salma ne us aurat mein ikhtilaf kya jo apne shohar ki wafat ke baad raaton se nafas pae. To Abu Salma ne kaha ke jab jo us ke pet mein hai waza kare to halal ho gayi. Aur Ibn Abbas ne kaha ke dono muddaton mein se aakhri. To Abu Huraira aae aur kaha ke main apne bhatije ke sath hun, yani Abu Salma, to unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas ke azad karda Kuraib ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ke paas bheja taake is ke bare mein us se puchhe, to wo un ke paas aaya aur unhein khabar di ke unhon ne kaha ke Aslami Sabia ne apne shohar ki wafat ke baad raaton se bacha jana to us ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to Aap ne farmaya ke halal ho gayin, jis se chaho nikah karo."
"1247","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ujra ke bete Kaab ke bete Ishaq ke bete Saeed se, unhon ne apni phuphi Ujra ke bete Kaab ki beti Zainab se riwayat kya ke Sinan ke bete Malik ki beti Faria ne, aur wo Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed ki behan hain, unhein khabar di ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aayin Aap se puchhti thin ke Banu Khudra mein apne ghar walon ki taraf lautein kyunke un ke shohar bhage hue ghulamon ki talash mein nikle yahan tak ke jab Qadum ke kinare par they to un se mile aur unhon ne unhein qatal kar diya. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se manga ke Banu Khudra mein apne ghar walon ki taraf lautun kyunke mere shohar ne mujhe aise rehne mein na chhora jo wo malik ho aur na nafaqa. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan. Unhon ne kaha ke main munsarif hui yahan tak ke jab hujre mein thi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhe pukara ya mere bare mein hukm diya aur mere liye pukari gayi to Aap ne farmaya ke tum ne kya kaha. To maine Aap se wo qissa dobara kaha jo maine Aap se apne shohar ke muamle mein zikr kya tha to Aap ne farmaya ke apne ghar mein thehro yahan tak ke kitab apni muddat tak pahunche. Unhon ne kaha ke maine is mein chaar mahine aur das din iddat guzari. Unhon ne kaha ke phir jab Affan ke bete Usman they to unhon ne meri taraf bheja aur mujh se is ke bare mein pucha to maine unhein khabar di to unhon ne is ki pairwi ki aur is se faisla kya."
"1248","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Qais ke bete Humaid se, unhon ne Shoaib ke bete Amr se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Khattab ke bete Umar bin Khattab un auraton ko jin ke shohar mar gae they Baida se lautate they, unhein hajj se rokte they."
"1249","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Khabbab ke bete Saib mar gae aur un ki biwi Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aayi aur un se apne shohar ki wafat ka zikr kya aur un se Qanat mein un ki kheti ka zikr kya aur un se pucha ke kya us ke liye durust hai ke is mein raat guzare. To unhon ne use is se mana kya to wo Madina se subah sawere nikalti aur subah un ki kheti mein pahunchti aur apna din is mein guzarti phir Madina mein dakhil hoti jab shaam hoti aur apne ghar mein raat guzarti."
"1250","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo us dehati aurat ke bare mein kehte they jis ka shohar mar jae ke wo wahan jane ka irada kare jahan us ke ghar wale jane ka irada karein. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai."
"1251","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jis ka shohar mar gaya ho wo aur mabtuta apne ghar ke siwa raat na guzarein."
"1252","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Muhammad ke bete Qasim ko kehte suna ke Malik ke bete Abdul Yazid ne mardon aur un ki auraton ke darmiyan judai karai jabke wo un mardon ki Ummahat Walad thin jo halaak ho gae they, to unhon ne aik ya do haiz ke baad in se nikah kya tha to un ke darmiyan judai karai yahan tak ke chaar mahine aur das din iddat guzarein. To Muhammad ke bete Qasim ne kaha ke Subhan Allah, Allah apni kitab mein kehte hain ke jo tum mein se mar jaein aur biwiyan chhorein, ye biwiyon mein se nahi hain."
"1253","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Umm Walad ki iddat jab us ka aaqa mar jae aik haiz hai."
"1254","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad ke bete Qasim se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke Umm Walad ki iddat jab us ka aaqa mar jae aik haiz hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai. Malik ne kaha ke agar wo un mein se na ho jo haiz aatin to us ki iddat teen mahine hai."
"1255","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman kehte they ke londi ki iddat jab us ka shohar halaak ho do mahine aur paanch raatein hai."
"1256","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se is jaisa riwayat kya. Malik ne us ghulam ke bare mein kaha jo londi ko aisi talaaq de jis mein us ne qatai na kya ho aur us ke liye us par ruju ho phir wo mare jabke wo us ki talaaq ki iddat mein ho ke wo us londi ki iddat guzare jis ka shohar mar gaya ho, do mahine aur paanch raatein, aur agar wo azad ho jae jabke us ke liye us par ruju ho phir wo azadi ke baad is se judai muntakhab na kare yahan tak ke wo mare jabke wo us ki talaaq ki iddat mein ho to wo us azaad ki iddat guzare jis ka shohar mar gaya ho, chaar mahine aur das din, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke us par wafat ki iddat to is ke baad wajeh hui ke wo azad hui to us ki iddat azaad ki iddat hai. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek hukm yehi hai."
"1257","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se, unhon ne Habban ke bete Muhammad bin Yahya se, unhon ne Muhairiz ke bete Ibn Muhairiz se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main masjid mein dakhil hua aur Khudri ke bete Abu Saeed ko dekha aur us ke paas baitha aur us se azal ke bare mein pucha. To Khudri ke bete Abu Saeed ne kaha ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Banu Mustaliq ke ghazwe mein nikle aur hum ne Arab ke qaidiyon mein se qaidi pae aur hum ne auraton ki khwahish ki aur hum par hijr sakht hua aur hum ne fidya pasand kya aur hum ne azal ka irada kya to hum ne kaha ke hum azal karte hain jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamare darmiyan hain is se pehle ke hum Aap se pucheinge. To hum ne Aap se is ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne farmaya ke tum par kuchh nahi ke na karo, Qiyamat ke din tak jo jaan hone wali hai wo hone wali hai."
"1258","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ubaidullah ke bete Umar ke azad karda Abu Nadr se, unhon ne Waqqas ke bete Abi Waqqas ke bete Saad ke bete Aamir se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo azal karte they."
"1259","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ubaidullah ke bete Umar ke azad karda Abu Nadr se, unhon ne Ansari Abu Ayyub ke azad karda Aflah ke bete Ibn Aflah se, unhon ne Ansari Abu Ayyub ki Umm Walad se riwayat kya ke wo azal karte they."
"1260","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar azal na karte they aur azal ko makrooh samajhte they."
"1261","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Mazini Saeed ke bete Damra se, unhon ne Ghaziya ke bete Amr ke bete Hajjaj se riwayat kya ke wo Sabit ke bete Zaid ke paas baithe they to un ke paas Qahd ka beta aaya, Yaman walon mein se aik mard, to us ne kaha ke aye Abu Saeed mere paas meri londiyan hain, meri wo biwiyan jinhein main panah deta hun mujhe in se zyada pasand nahi hain aur in sab mein mujhe pasand nahi ke mujh se haamila hon, to kya main azal karun. To Sabit ke bete Zaid ne kaha ke use fatwa do aye Hajjaj. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke Allah tumhein bakhshe, hum to tumhare paas baithete hain taake tum se seekhein. Unhon ne kaha ke use fatwa do. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke wo tumhari kheti hai agar tum chaho use serab karo aur agar tum chaho use pyasa rakho. Unhon ne kaha ke main ye Zaid se sunta tha to Zaid ne kaha ke us ne sach kaha."
"1262","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Qais ke bete Humaid se, unhon ne aik mard se jise Zuzaif kaha jata hai riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Ibn Abbas se azal ke bare mein pucha gaya to unhon ne apni aik londi ko bulaya aur kaha ke inhein khabar do. To goya wo sharmayi. To unhon ne kaha ke yehi hai, raha main to karta hun, yani ke wo azal karte hain. Malik ne kaha ke mard azaad aurat se us ki ijazat ke baghair azal na kare aur apni londi se us ki ijazat ke baghair azal karne mein koi harj nahi, aur jo qoum ki londi us ke nikah mein ho wo azal na kare magar un ki ijazat se."
"1263","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Nafi ke bete Humaid se, unhon ne Salma ki beti Abi Salma ki beti Zainab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein ye teen hadisein khabar din. Zainab ne kaha ke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Habiba ke paas dakhil hui jab un ke walid Harb ke bete Abu Sufyan mar gae to Umm Habiba ne khushbu mangwai jis mein zardi khaluq ya is ke ilawa thi to us se londi ko tel lagaya phir apne rukhsaron se masa kya phir kaha ke Allah ki qasam mujhe khushbu ki koi haajat nahi siwae is ke ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhne wali aurat ke liye halal nahi ke murde par teen raaton se zyada sog kare magar shohar par chaar mahine aur das din."
"1264","Zainab ne kaha ke phir main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Jahsh ki beti Zainab ke paas dakhil hui jab un ke bhai mar gae to unhon ne khushbu mangwai aur is mein se masa kya phir kaha ke Allah ki qasam mujhe khushbu ki koi haajat nahi siwae is ke ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhne wali aurat ke liye halal nahi ke murde par teen raaton se zyada sog kare magar shohar par chaar mahine aur das din."
"1265","Zainab ne kaha ke maine apni walida Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ko kehte suna ke aik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah meri beti ka shohar mar gaya hai aur us ki aankhein dukh rahi hain to kya main inhein surma lagaun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, do ya teen martaba, har martaba kehte ke nahi, phir farmaya ke ye to chaar mahine aur das din hain, aur tum mein se aik Jahiliya mein saal ke sar par mendhni phenkti thi. Nafi ke bete Humaid ne kaha ke maine Zainab se kaha ke saal ke sar par mendhni phenkna kya hai. To Zainab ne kaha ke aurat jab us ka shohar mar jata to jhopdi mein dakhil hoti aur badtareen kapde pehenti aur na khushbu chhuti aur na koi cheez yahan tak ke us par saal guzar jata phir us ke paas janwar laya jata gadha ya bakri ya parinda to is se ragadti, phir kam hi is se ragadti magar mar jata, phir nikalti aur mendhni di jati aur use phenkti phir is ke baad jo chahe khushbu ya is ke ilawa ki taraf lautti."
"1266","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Ubaid ki beti Safiya bint Abi Ubaid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zaujaon Aaisha aur Hafsa se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke iman wali aurat ke liye halal nahi."
"1267","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma ne us aurat se kaha jo apne shohar par sog kar rahi thi aur us ki aankhein dukh rahi thin to ye is se had tak pahuncha ke raat mein jala ka surma lagao aur din mein use ponchh do."
"1268","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Abdullah ke bete Salim aur Yasar ke bete Sulaiman se khabar pahunchi ke wo dono us aurat ke bare mein kehte they jis ka shohar mar jae ke jab wo apni beenai par ashk ya shikayat se dare jo use pesh aae ke wo surma lagae aur dawai ya surme se ilaj karae agarche is mein khushbu ho. Malik ne kaha ke jab zarurat ho to Allah ka deen aasan hai."
"1269","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Ubaid ki beti Safiya bint Abi Ubaid ne apni aankhon ki shikayat ki jabke wo apne shohar Umar ke bete Abdullah par sog kar rahi thin to unhon ne surma na lagaya yahan tak ke un ki dono aankhein qareeb thin ke mail se bhar jaein. Malik ne kaha ke jis ka shohar mar gaya ho wo tel aur shibriq aur is jaisa se tel lagae jab is mein khushbu na ho. Malik ne kaha ke apne shohar par sog karne wali aurat zewar mein se koi cheez na pehne, na anguthi aur na paizeb aur na zewar mein se is ke ilawa, aur dhaari dar kapde mein se koi cheez na pehne magar ke moti dhaari ho, aur rang mein se kisi rang se ranga hua kapda na pehne magar siyah se, aur kanghi na kare magar ber aur is jaisa se jo us ke sar mein khameer na ho."
"1270","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Umm Salma ke paas dakhil hue jabke wo Abu Salma par sog kar rahi thin aur unhon ne apni aankhon par elwa rakha tha to Aap ne farmaya ke ye kya hai aye Umm Salma. To unhon ne kaha ke ye to elwa hai ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke use raat mein rakho aur din mein ponchh do."
"1271","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma kehti thin ke sog karne wali apna sar ber aur tel se jama kare."
